  description: "# Description\nImplement unit tests for \"Subscription reconnection:\
    \ verify reconnecting subscribers receive current state\" #11534\n\n## Summary\n\
    - `subscription_reconnect_receives_current_state` \u2014 verifies reconnecting\
    \ subscribers receive full current state including   additions/removals made while\
    \ disconnected\n- `subscription_reconnect_with_topic_filter` \u2014 verifies topic\
    \ filtering works correctly on reconnect and filter can change between connections"
